{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_title", "source_sha256": "4d295d493d9eb37de64665014a713833db8dd0dcbefe4d0433844db3e3ab70a8", "ja": "麗花とおでかけ1", "zh": "和丽花外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a03ca340c0d3cc326a72b065e7b7b15088289b44d7b151758e4c8c5bade03b35", "ja": "麗花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与丽花一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "787e2db3201ea18ad5669329bc03069b1024acdbad3a1caf4217286d27158b23", "ja": "（番組の企画で、麗花が越前焼の陶芸に挑戦した。\nかなり上手だったけど、驚いたな……！）", "zh": "（节目企划安排丽花挑战越前烧陶艺。她做得相当好，真让我吃了一惊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3b7df054ed19a9e5f5a7ed70b749020c0951b73b416f800b033c0feec1e25390", "ja": "お疲れ様、麗花。陶芸、ずいぶん上手くできてたな。\nやった事があるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花。你的陶艺做得相当不错啊。\n以前做过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "23f8dca779f6650406af8489b4209ab77bacd5bfb5a92e319e9d6216b3e5a73a", "ja": "いいえ、ないですよ。なんか、ぐるぐるーってする時に\n心をキュッとしてたら、綺麗にできました！", "zh": "没有哦。在转呀转～的时候，\n只要把心绷紧一点，就做得漂漂亮亮了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "79900c314f82ddc3520798ec85d6d8c090b6af503b529d5e03ee859ffe1592b3", "ja": "そ、そうか。よくわからないけど、すごいな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。虽然不太明白，但真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "e60633e0281833c5f3c7a5a68f05815008a5655b3e68a55bb26ec3fb2b108ffc", "ja": "越前焼、素敵ですよね。渋い色味で、艶もあって！\nいいなー。いつか越前焼の似合うお家に住みたいなー！", "zh": "越前烧真漂亮啊。颜色沉稳，表面还有光泽！\n真好啊——。我以后也想住进一栋适合越前烧的房子里——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "356d8a243e51c0368d75f649c4eeb1d77027db28f6c017b69eb8b0c15627a4e9", "ja": "越前焼の似合うお家か……。\nやっぱり、日本家屋とかかな。", "zh": "适合越前烧的房子啊……\n果然还是日式房屋之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f4ad2c9aec6056f770950260edaea506dce1980ce5ef68a9994d146027b0307", "ja": "そうですね！　でも、いくら素敵なお家でも、\n部屋が散らかってたら台無しですよね。うーん……。", "zh": "是啊！不过，再漂亮的房子，要是房间里乱糟糟的，也就全毁了呢。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0f8f62dd2c784c5ad403700a151039b8e48fc8c6715bf8a268a196d3a57a9982", "ja": "そうだな。\nじゃあこれを機会に、部屋の片付けを……。", "zh": "是啊。\n那就趁这个机会，把房间收拾一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "88a9377ac064a6c99ccae221f1aa229b8aaf4821d8ec4592e613a4f66e8743ad", "ja": "あっ！　だったら、越前焼で大きな入れ物を作って、\n物はぜーんぶそこに入れちゃうのはどうですか？", "zh": "啊！那样的话，不如用越前烧做一个大容器，把东西全都塞进去，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "1fc005efe63b640c139faab13a1e07bacff73d76bd8463dc2e171eafb88819bc", "ja": "それとも……お家そのものを、越前焼にしちゃうとか！\nこっちだったら、お掃除もしなくてすみますね♪", "zh": "还是说……把房子本身做成越前烧的也行！  \n这样的话，连打扫都省了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "79fa1a63891e33d79f5e0be8ee53b1959ec0156c065be3634edb6f2da929bcd5", "ja": "いや、それはちょっと……というか、\nそんなに大きな入れ物、焼き窯に入らないような……。", "zh": "不，那就有点……不对，这么大的容器，恐怕也放不进窑里吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1b8f3e45698392e3d561e89cc90e44fb81412f6605219bf798c8708e9410c9fe", "ja": "（とはいえ、こういう自由な発想も麗花の長所だ。\nあまり否定するものじゃないな。多分！）", "zh": "（话虽如此，这种自由的想象力也是丽花的优点。还是不要过分否定她比较好。大概吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
